    "name": "General",
    "visible": 1,
    "summary": "<h3 dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>POO en Lenguaje Python</strong><br><span style=\"font-weight: normal; font-size: 0.9375rem;\">curso 2026|27</span></h3>\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>Profesor</strong></span>:<br>Javier Caselli Fernández <em>(<a href=\"mailto:jcasfer695@g.educaand.es\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">jcasfer695@g.educaand.es</a>)</em></p>\r\n<p><strong style=\"font-size: 0.9375rem;\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">Horario de clases</span>:</strong></p>\r\n<table style=\"width: 31.4342%; height: 53px;\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 27px;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 32.3662%; height: 27px;\"><strong>Lunes</strong></td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 67.637%; height: 27px;\">de 17:15 a 20:30</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 27px;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 32.3662%; height: 27px;\"><strong>Miércoles</strong></td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 67.637%; height: 27px;\">de 15:15 a 17:15</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<p></p>\r\n<p><strong style=\"font-size: 0.9375rem;\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">Google Meet</span>:</strong><br><a href=\"https://meet.google.com/oxp-tbyi-sbc\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Acceso a la Sala de Google Meet del módulo</a></p>\r\n<p><strong>Repositorio Github del curso:</strong><br><a href=\"https://github.com/javiercaselli/POODALP2627\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Acceso al repositorio Github del curso</a></p>\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: left;\">El material de este módulo estará sometido a proceso de revisión conforme avance el curso.</p>",
